Error [E0112]: Int (a whole number) can't use `:Fixed(n)`
  --> tests/ui/fixed_interpolation_non_float.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     print("{count:Fixed(2)}")
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: fixed interpolation uses `core.fmt.decimal`, which formats `Float` values
 Fix: pass a `Float`, or use bare interpolation for this value
